d/key "answer"] [:db/add "b5c6c5cb-db09-5e6a-a59f-5fe0515399f8" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "b5c6c5cb-db09-5e6a-a59f-5fe0515399f8" :answer-field/choices "f67e09f1-403e-57c8-8023-e3ff5077ebe1"] [:db/add "b5c6c5cb-db09-5e6a-a59f-5fe0515399f8" :answer-field/choices "5e389db1-2d85-5e36-a218-ad88b7eb5510"] [:db/add "b5c6c5cb-db09-5e6a-a59f-5fe0515399f8" :answer-field/choices "fc30e8b5-8adf-593b-b56d-55d8e550186d"] [:db/add "b5c6c5cb-db09-5e6a-a59f-5fe0515399f8" :answer-field/choices "ad70f13e-1e63-5272-90e0-6561302e9a1c"] [:db/add "b5c6c5cb-db09-5e6a-a59f-5fe0515399f8" :answer-field/choices "7e724334-b972-5c48-8ba7-5510419c6c79"] [:db/add "b5c6c5cb-db09-5e6a-a59f-5fe0515399f8" :answer-field/correct "f67e09f1-403e-57c8-8023-e3ff5077ebe1"] [:db/ensure "b5c6c5cb-db09-5e6a-a59f-5fe0515399f8" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "4c75abf2-3c56-52f1-9ae3-4510d2d71ce0" :question/id #uuid "4c75abf2-3c56-52f1-9ae3-4510d2d71ce0"] [:db/add "4c75abf2-3c56-52f1-9ae3-4510d2d71ce0" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{4}{x^{2} + 25}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nYou may use $\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}+C$.\n\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant."] [:db/add "4c75abf2-3c56-52f1-9ae3-4510d2d71ce0" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{x}{5}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{1}{5})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\n\n$$\nx^{2} + 25=25\\left(1+(\\frac{x}{5})^2\\right).\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=5\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\frac{4}{25}\\cdot 5=\\frac{4}{5}$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{4}{x^{2} + 25}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{4}{5}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the supplied primitive:\n\n$$\n\\frac{4}{5}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{4}{5}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{4}{5}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{x}{5} \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "4c75abf2-3c56-52f1-9ae3-4510d2d71ce0" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "4c75abf2-3c56-52f1-9ae3-4510d2d71ce0" :question/answer-fields "b5c6c5cb-db09-5e6a-a59f-5fe0515399f8"] [:db/ensure "4c75abf2-3c56-52f1-9ae3-4510d2d71ce0" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064219 :knowledge-point/questions "4c75abf2-3c56-52f1-9ae3-4510d2d71ce0"] [:db/add "b130ca0a-2533-5e9c-864a-ebb92e98aaa0" :answer/id #uuid "b130ca0a-2533-5e9c-864a-ebb92e98aaa0"] [:db/add "b130ca0a-2533-5e9c-864a-ebb92e98aaa0" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "b130ca0a-2533-5e9c-864a-ebb92e98aaa0" :answer/value "\\frac{3}{2}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "b130ca0a-2533-5e9c-864a-ebb92e98aaa0" :answer/validate] [:db/add "3c8ff4ae-c9fe-5952-9c43-f7cdf215894d" :answer/id #uuid "3c8ff4ae-c9fe-5952-9c43-f7cdf215894d"] [:db/add "3c8ff4ae-c9fe-5952-9c43-f7cdf215894d" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "3c8ff4ae-c9fe-5952-9c43-f7cdf215894d" :answer/value "3\\left(\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "3c8ff4ae-c9fe-5952-9c43-f7cdf215894d" :answer/validate] [:db/add "232d27ea-930a-565a-875d-f68023a5ca43" :answer/id #uuid "232d27ea-930a-565a-875d-f68023a5ca43"] [:db/add "232d27ea-930a-565a-875d-f68023a5ca43" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "232d27ea-930a-565a-875d-f68023a5ca43" :answer/value "\\frac{3}{2}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(x \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "232d27ea-930a-565a-875d-f68023a5ca43" :answer/validate] [:db/add "c2a395f5-e921-58b5-8243-44ec93d99e0f" :answer/id #uuid "c2a395f5-e921-58b5-8243-44ec93d99e0f"] [:db/add "c2a395f5-e921-58b5-8243-44ec93d99e0f" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "c2a395f5-e921-58b5-8243-44ec93d99e0f" :answer/value "\\frac{3}{2}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{3 x}{2} \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "c2a395f5-e921-58b5-8243-44ec93d99e0f" :answer/vali