in the denominator:\n\n$$\nx^{2} + 4=4\\left(1+(\\frac{x}{2})^2\\right).\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=2\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\frac{3}{4}\\cdot 2=\\frac{3}{2}$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{3}{x^{2} + 4}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{3}{2}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the supplied primitive:\n\n$$\n\\frac{3}{2}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{3}{2}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{3}{2}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "2ec1bd3a-f1d2-5889-a32f-fa1e4c67df66" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "2ec1bd3a-f1d2-5889-a32f-fa1e4c67df66" :question/answer-fields "fcff6ec7-0b9c-5bbd-a7dd-739136044bb7"] [:db/ensure "2ec1bd3a-f1d2-5889-a32f-fa1e4c67df66" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064219 :knowledge-point/questions "2ec1bd3a-f1d2-5889-a32f-fa1e4c67df66"] [:db/add "b298230a-1049-5d41-8f2e-94d615b198cf" :answer/id #uuid "b298230a-1049-5d41-8f2e-94d615b198cf"] [:db/add "b298230a-1049-5d41-8f2e-94d615b198cf" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "b298230a-1049-5d41-8f2e-94d615b198cf" :answer/value "\\frac{4}{3}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{x}{3} \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "b298230a-1049-5d41-8f2e-94d615b198cf" :answer/validate] [:db/add "eecabed7-b925-57d6-af70-0bdc320abf88" :answer/id #uuid "eecabed7-b925-57d6-af70-0bdc320abf88"] [:db/add "eecabed7-b925-57d6-af70-0bdc320abf88" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "eecabed7-b925-57d6-af70-0bdc320abf88" :answer/value "- \\frac{4}{3}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{x}{3} \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "eecabed7-b925-57d6-af70-0bdc320abf88" :answer/validate] [:db/add "5f2d2d1e-385b-5d13-920a-d5cb7b2a01e0" :answer/id #uuid "5f2d2d1e-385b-5d13-920a-d5cb7b2a01e0"] [:db/add "5f2d2d1e-385b-5d13-920a-d5cb7b2a01e0" :answer/type :answer.type/math] 