es "e0ff5cad-6c11-5945-ad0f-af90c37cd586"] [:db/add "c1310a9a-e39a-50df-8130-176f837e92a4" :answer-field/choices "00bd529d-5619-554b-98ef-bb9eda9ba34b"] [:db/add "c1310a9a-e39a-50df-8130-176f837e92a4" :answer-field/choices "6ebb6278-fb1b-584b-875f-82787899a979"] [:db/add "c1310a9a-e39a-50df-8130-176f837e92a4" :answer-field/correct "00bd529d-5619-554b-98ef-bb9eda9ba34b"] [:db/ensure "c1310a9a-e39a-50df-8130-176f837e92a4" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "3c45b143-0142-5c16-8523-c40cf2bdae19" :question/id #uuid "3c45b143-0142-5c16-8523-c40cf2bdae19"] [:db/add "3c45b143-0142-5c16-8523-c40cf2bdae19" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{4}{x^{2} + 16}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nYou may use $\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}+C$.\n\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant."] [:db/add "3c45b143-0142-5c16-8523-c40cf2bdae19" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{x}{4}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{1}{4})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\n\n$$\nx^{2} + 16=16\\left(1+(\\frac{x}{4})^2\\right).\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=4\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\frac{1}{4}\\cdot 4=1$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{4}{x^{2} + 16}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the supplied primitive:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{x}{4} \\right)}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "3c45b143-0142-5c16-8523-c40cf2bdae19" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "3c45b143-0142-5c16-8523-c40cf2bdae19" :question/answer-fields "c1310a9a-e39a-50df-8130-176f837e92a4"] [:db/ensure "3c45b143-0142-5c16-8523-c40cf2bdae19" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064219 :knowledge-point/questions "3c45b143-0142-5c16-8523-c40cf2bdae19"] [:db/add "38381c6a-cc32-5e80-a57a-8aa1