-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "b549f067-9eab-535e-aca0-94511e920aed" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "b549f067-9eab-535e-aca0-94511e920aed" :answer-field/choices "38381c6a-cc32-5e80-a57a-8aa141d23b66"] [:db/add "b549f067-9eab-535e-aca0-94511e920aed" :answer-field/choices "fbae1f76-4d79-554d-8607-4733c05b1131"] [:db/add "b549f067-9eab-535e-aca0-94511e920aed" :answer-field/choices "d3b094e3-12c1-5c4e-acc3-ade73d648c56"] [:db/add "b549f067-9eab-535e-aca0-94511e920aed" :answer-field/choices "615b28c0-70df-5553-9719-f4708f433236"] [:db/add "b549f067-9eab-535e-aca0-94511e920aed" :answer-field/choices "2ef3a502-7f3b-5c57-9d7d-899b69c174c6"] [:db/add "b549f067-9eab-535e-aca0-94511e920aed" :answer-field/correct "fbae1f76-4d79-554d-8607-4733c05b1131"] [:db/ensure "b549f067-9eab-535e-aca0-94511e920aed" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "f2f4ede1-9811-5924-85a4-605fbf1587ed" :question/id #uuid "f2f4ede1-9811-5924-85a4-605fbf1587ed"] [:db/add "f2f4ede1-9811-5924-85a4-605fbf1587ed" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{4}{x^{2} + 4}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nYou may use $\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}+C$.\n\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant."] [:db/add "f2f4ede1-9811-5924-85a4-605fbf1587ed" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{x}{2}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{1}{2})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\n\n$$\nx^{2} + 4=4\\left(1+(\\frac{x}{2})^2\\right).\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=2\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $1\\cdot 2=2$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{4}{x^{2} + 4}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=2\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the supplied primitive:\n\n$$\n2\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=2\\left(\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n2\\left(\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "f2f4ede1-9811-5924-85a4-605fbf1587ed" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "f2f4ede1-9811-5924-85a4-605fbf1587ed" :question/answer-fields "b549f067-9eab-535e-aca0-94511e920aed"] [:db/ensure "f2f4ede1-9811-5924-85a4-605fbf1587ed" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064219 :knowledge-point/questions "f2f4ede1-9811-5924-85a4-605fbf1587ed"] [:db/add "8da5362a-d288-5f11-9b3b-e9b62d156552" :answer/id #uuid "8da5362a-d288-5f11-9b3b-e9b62d156552"] [:db/add "8da5362a-d288-5f11-9b3b-e9b62d156552" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "8da5362a-d288-5f11-9b3b-e9b62d156552" :answer/value "\\frac{3}{5}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(x \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "8da5362a-d288-5f11-9b3b-e9b62d156552" :answer/validate] [:db/add "67a0376c-c630-5fc4-8771-3ca9ed7214cb" :answer/id #uuid "67a0376c-c630-5fc4-8771-3ca9ed7214cb"] [:db/add "67a0376c-c630-5fc4-8771-3ca9ed7214cb" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "67a0376c-c630-5fc4-8771-3ca9ed7214cb" :answer/value "\\frac{3}{5}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{x}{5} \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "67a0376c-c630-5fc4-8771-3ca9ed7214cb" :answer/validate] [:db/add "d7e493d1-d97b-564e-9084-5f55b6b44649" :answer/id #uuid "d7e493d1-d97b-564e-9084-5f55b6b44649"] [:db/add "d7e493d1-d97b-564e-9084-5f55b6b44649" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "d7e493d1-d97b-564e-9084-5f55b6b44649" :answer/value "- \\frac{3}{5}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{x}{5} \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "d7e493d1-d97b-564e-9084-5f55b6b44649" :answer/validate] [:db/add "ca9d0fe8-b918-5c2a-a1d3-1a648dfc4099" :answer/id #uuid "ca9d0fe8-b918-5c2a-a1d3-1a648dfc4099"] [:db/add "ca9d0fe8-b918-5c2a-a1d3-1a648dfc4099" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "ca9d0fe8-b918-5c2a-a1d3-1a648dfc4099" :answer/value "\\frac{3}{5}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{2 x}{5} \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "ca9d0fe8-b918-5c2a-a1d3-1a648dfc4099" :answer/validate] [:db/add "c24939c5-b63d-54ce-a232-af99f0da840a"