c18-3a3f-5582-bbc8-8eeab8516ccf"] [:db/add "50febb24-d674-5ebb-9fba-764db720a20e" :answer-field/choices "6e3a7273-7cff-55ae-85af-733b12ff2f1a"] [:db/add "50febb24-d674-5ebb-9fba-764db720a20e" :answer-field/choices "cd7d9498-dfd6-5c08-b1d7-e32a9db8ebe4"] [:db/add "50febb24-d674-5ebb-9fba-764db720a20e" :answer-field/correct "6e3a7273-7cff-55ae-85af-733b12ff2f1a"] [:db/ensure "50febb24-d674-5ebb-9fba-764db720a20e" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "8cb9ae74-785b-5945-9fad-c291fd0cc3e9" :question/id #uuid "8cb9ae74-785b-5945-9fad-c291fd0cc3e9"] [:db/add "8cb9ae74-785b-5945-9fad-c291fd0cc3e9" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{4}{16 x^{2} + 4}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nYou may use $\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}+C$.\n\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant."] [:db/add "8cb9ae74-785b-5945-9fad-c291fd0cc3e9" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=2 x$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(2)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\n\n$$\n16 x^{2} + 4=4\\left(1+(2 x)^2\\right).\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{1}{2}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $1\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}=\\frac{1}{2}$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{4}{16 x^{2} + 4}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the supplied primitive:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(2 x \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "8cb9ae74-785b-5945-9fad-c291fd0cc3e9" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "8cb9ae74-785b-5945-9fad-c291fd0cc3e9" :question/answer-fields "50febb24-d674-5ebb-9fba-764db720a20e"] [:db/ensure "8cb9ae74-785b-5945-9fad-c291fd0cc3e9" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064219 :knowledge-point/questions "8cb9ae74-785b-5945-9fad-c291fd0cc3e9"] [:db/add "aa03fc8b-26f9-5fd8-bb0a-1b4779a395d2" :answer/id #uuid "aa03fc8b-26f9-5fd8-bb0a-1b4779a395d2"] [:db/add "aa03fc8b-26f9-5fd8-bb0a-1b4779a395d2" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "aa03fc8b-26f9-5fd8-bb0a-1b4779a395d2" :answer/value "\\frac{1}{4}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(x \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "aa03fc8b-26f9-5fd8-bb0a-1b4779a395d2" :answer/validate] [:db/add "02456f98-038f-5ed0-acdd-f1c3d8deacbc" :answer/id #uuid "02456f98-038f-5ed0-acdd-f1c3d8deacbc"] [:db/add "02456f98-038f-5ed0-acdd-f1c3d8deacbc" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "02456f98-038f-5ed0-acdd-f1c3d8deacbc" :answer/value "- \\frac{1}{4}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{4 x}{3} \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "02456f98-038f-5ed0-acdd-f1c3d8deacbc" :answer/validate] [:db/add "8acaf851-189e-5465-ba12-9e6ddae0822c" :answer/id #uuid "8acaf851-189e-5465-ba12-9e6ddae0822c"] [:db/add "8acaf851-189e-5465-ba12-9e6ddae0822c" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "8acaf851-189e-5465-ba12-9e6ddae0822c" :answer/value "\\frac{1}{4}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{8 x}{3} \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "8acaf851-189e-5465-ba12-9e6ddae0822c" :answer/validate] [:db/add "e04af6d3-0e03-5b32-9bc8-c398dc26c38d" :answer/id #uuid "e04af6d3-0e03-5b32-9bc8-c398dc26c38d"] [:db/add "e04af6d3-0e03-5b32-9bc8-c398dc26c38d" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "e04af6d3-0e03-5b32-9bc8-c398dc26c38d" :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{4 x}{3} \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "e04af6d3-0e03-5b32-9bc8-c398dc26c38d" :answer/validate] [:db/add "3a248562-1231-5a5e-a3ae-4e593809931e" :answer/id #uuid "3a248562-1231-5a5e-a3ae-4e593809931e"] [:db/add "3a248562-1231-5a5e-a3ae-4e593809931e" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "3a248562-1231-5a5e-a3ae-4e593809931e" :answer/value "\\frac{1}{4}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{4 x}{3} \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "3a248562-1231-5a5e-a3ae-4e593809931e" :answer/validate] [:db/add "5f002c17-a