{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the supplied primitive:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{4}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{1}{4}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{4}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{4 x}{3} \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "4eb29d6a-94bf-5b00-ab1f-82e6f676f794" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "4eb29d6a-94bf-5b00-ab1f-82e6f676f794" :question/answer-fields "5f002c17-a5ff-55eb-8281-188e54316537"] [:db/ensure "4eb29d6a-94bf-5b00-ab1f-82e6f676f794" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064219 :knowledge-point/questions "4eb29d6a-94bf-5b00-ab1f-82e6f676f794"] [:db/add "a863748c-b7b0-57ed-a2d1-c4768c32c9f8" :answer/id #uuid "a863748c-b7b0-57ed-a2d1-c4768c32c9f8"] [:db/add "a863748c-b7b0-57ed-a2d1-c4768c32c9f8" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "a863748c-b7b0-57ed-a2d1-c4768c32c9f8" :answer/value "\\frac{3}{10}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{4 x}{5} \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "a863748c-b7b0-57ed-a2d1-c4768c32c9f8" :answer/validate] [:db/add "e5ff479f-2bb2-5c6c-a7fc-d8d302a1d75f" :answer/id #uuid "e5ff479f-2bb2-5c6c-a7fc-d8d302a1d75f"] [:db/add "e5ff479f-2bb2-5c6c-a7fc-d8d302a1d75f" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "e5ff479f-2bb2-5c6c-a7fc-d8d302a1d75f" :answer/value "\\frac{3}{20}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(x \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "e5ff479f-2bb2-5c6c-a7fc-d8d302a1d75f" :answer/validate] [:db/add "5c7bca56-9a08-5580-b2a4-8be3e3b46efa" :answer/id #uuid "5c7bca56-9a08-5580-b2a4-8be3e3b46efa"] [:db/add "5c7bca56-9a08-5580-b2a4-8be3e3b46efa" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "5c7bca56-9a08-5580-b2a4-8be3e3b46efa" :answer/value "- \\frac{3}{20}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{4 x}{5} \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "5c7bca56-9a08-5580-b2a4-8be3e3b46efa" :answer/validate] [:db/add "d117ff90-57d3-57f3-869b-729814a6f15b" :answer/id #uuid "d117ff90-57d3-57f3-869b-729814a6f15b"] [:db/add "d117ff90-57d3-57f3-869b-729814a6f15b" :answer/type :answer.type/math]