\frac{3 x}{4})^2\\right).\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{4}{3}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\frac{1}{8}\\cdot \\frac{4}{3}=\\frac{1}{6}$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{2}{9 x^{2} + 16}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{1}{6}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the supplied primitive:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{6}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{1}{6}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{6}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{3 x}{4} \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "7a2f0386-5d91-5d21-89ac-b116944261ea" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "7a2f0386-5d91-5d21-89ac-b116944261ea" :question/answer-fields "2a92e119-56af-5b6e-9ae4-011836f48d63"] [:db/ensure "7a2f0386-5d91-5d21-89ac-b116944261ea" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064219 :knowledge-point/questions "7a2f0386-5d91-5d21-89ac-b116944261ea"] [:db/add "52c45dc3-30dd-53aa-b8f3-667ff2be361d" :answer/id #uuid "52c45dc3-30dd-53aa-b8f3-667ff2be361d"] [:db/add "52c45dc3-30dd-53aa-b8f3-667ff2be361d" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "52c45dc3-30dd-53aa-b8f3-667ff2be361d" :answer/value "\\frac{1}{3}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{3 x}{2} \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "52c45dc3-30dd-53aa-b8f3-667ff2be361d" :answer/validate] [:db/add "948eada2-b615-5a51-8cc5-fd9fe61725e9" :answer/id #uuid "948eada2-b615-5a51-8cc5-fd9fe61725e9"] [:db/add "948eada2-b615-5a51-8cc5-fd9fe61725e9" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "948eada2-b615-5a51-8cc5-fd9fe61725e9" :answer/value "\\frac{2}{3}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{3 x}{2} \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "948eada2-b615-5a51-8cc5-fd9fe61725e9" :answer/validate] [:db/add "dfe4ffa6-de38-562d-9bf4-f1904dda7934" :answer/id #uuid "dfe4ffa6-de38-562d-9bf4-f1904dda7934"] [:db/add "dfe4ffa6-de38-562d-9bf4-f1904dda7934" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "dfe4ffa6-de3